function m0008 ParseUnicode
	access private
	returns Result<int,Json.ParseError>
	doc "Reads the four hex digits of a \\u escape (the position is on the first) and appends the code point as UTF-8; a high surrogate must be followed by a \\u escape of a low one, and the pair is one code point. A lone surrogate is an error."
