wire p000.then p003.in
wire p004.result p005.a
wire p005.result p006.condition
wire p003.body p006.in
wire p006.true p007.in
wire p008.value p009.a
wire p007.then p00a.in
wire p009.result p00a.value
wire p006.false p00b.in
wire p00a.then p00b.in
wire p003.done p00c.in

